{"steam_appid":4594150,"steam_name":"Sir, We Have an Orc Problem","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4594150/1062943413/20c4fbee5e629adc4a2c625aa2eb3cd2a7177375/1785177475/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785243285","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257385953/ab7295045fd74e6beae721207775b41a319fc25b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785243285","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/5b8bab5078ed7e86e1fb11e9cfd097b99a79e3ec/ss_5b8bab5078ed7e86e1fb11e9cfd097b99a79e3ec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785828320","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/80052875695670a2056251c5f19bea89ecdb8e5c/ss_80052875695670a2056251c5f19bea89ecdb8e5c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785828320","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/3163e6cf75b226d1599629ec49d8f2f466a3756e/ss_3163e6cf75b226d1599629ec49d8f2f466a3756e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785828320","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/2910f20f7f0a873c3e112d8ae9bd6c5db41850d8/ss_2910f20f7f0a873c3e112d8ae9bd6c5db41850d8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785828320","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/4a6369d287fd474652e14606cdeadd94c526401f/ss_4a6369d287fd474652e14606cdeadd94c526401f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785828320"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sir, We Have an Orc Problem</strong> </i>is a short tower defense game with incremental-style meta-progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A bazillion orcs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against an overwhelming number of orcs. They're coming with tens of thousands of troops to overrun you. Greet them with even more bullets, bombs and lasers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/d18eacb7d0dd4b06cb5fcbe3e482824e.poster.avif?t=1785828320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/d18eacb7d0dd4b06cb5fcbe3e482824e.webm?t=1785828320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/d18eacb7d0dd4b06cb5fcbe3e482824e.mp4?t=1785828320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive upgrade tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources earned from every run, won or lost, to unlock and upgrade powerful turrets. Every upgrade brings you closer to defeating the horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/c4c82312d060a9dd4953fafb79cabc0b.poster.avif?t=1785828320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/c4c82312d060a9dd4953fafb79cabc0b.webm?t=1785828320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/c4c82312d060a9dd4953fafb79cabc0b.mp4?t=1785828320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch strafing runs, orbital lasers and even nukes to slaughter masses of orcs and survive critical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/cb6e020aa9486bd4ccb8ec7e2a0c0b34.poster.avif?t=1785828320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/cb6e020aa9486bd4ccb8ec7e2a0c0b34.webm?t=1785828320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594150/extras/cb6e020aa9486bd4ccb8ec7e2a0c0b34.mp4?t=1785828320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any x86_64 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan 1.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any x86_64 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with Vulkan 1.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Mumpitz Games"],"publishers":["Mumpitz Games"],"release_date":"28 Jul, 2026"}